# What makes CloudState.qml a singleton. `pragma Singleton` in the file alone
# is not enough: the type has to be declared singleton here too, or the name
# resolves to the component type instead of an instance and every property
# read off it is undefined (omavnc's qmldir says the same).
#
# No `module` line on purpose: the shell loads BarWidget.qml by file URL, and
# the name below is reached through the implicit import of its directory.
singleton CloudState 1.0 CloudState.qml
